  "notes": [
    "Preflight first. No retry, resume, failed-hand replacement, checkpoint change, or cross-session context carry.",
    "Initial final-code preflight completed 140 offline fixture hands but failed stateful replay because active contextual decision telemetry omitted uniform. Zero Slumbot hands attempted. Evidence preserved; recovery changes metadata only.",
    "Recovery preflight passed every gate. Bundle SHA remained d5cda4c74e2745f73a4b2290798606fdd00aa827c681f563adf7be534bc857d2; 512-state parity and zero-context exactness passed; 527 stateful decision replays passed across two independent sessions.",
    "Full suite 294/294 passed immediately before launch. Frozen deployment SHA d5cda4c74e2745f73a4b2290798606fdd00aa827c681f563adf7be534bc857d2; Standard10 base SHA 91b0c587a5a76e9a8f38217e0b304136ef298118a99b69cc743899fc4b16e428; fixed sessions=8, hands/session=625, seeds=2026092201..2026092208. No replacement.",
    "All eight immutable live processes completed exactly625 hands with COMPLETED summaries and empty stderr (5000 total). Bench post-processing falsely failed because Start-Process ExitCode properties were stale/null; no session failed and no retry occurred. Recovery is read-only over the original eight session directories.",
    "Stateful journal audit PASS across all original sessions: 5000 hands, 15284 frozen decisions, disjoint token chains.",
    "Raw 5000-hand result: -51.75 bb/100, CI95 [-89.52,-13.98], baseline delta -40.32. Session independence PASS with zero same-position visible-deal matches across all 28 pairs.",
    "Same-run descriptive audit: cold512 +1.367 bb/100; active4488 -57.810. Context changed only228/13710 active decisions (1.663%). Changed-hand outcomes were positive descriptively while unchanged hands carried the loss, so this run rejects the frozen external gate but does not identify contextual action drift as the causal mechanism."
